B.bbG=new A.V(B.cD,["Online AI is currently unavailable. OCR and local analysis still work on this device.","Deadline calendar","No open deadlines.","{today} today \xb7 {week} this week \xb7 {overdue} overdue","Privacy choice","May we measure anonymous visits and installation clicks? We never store letters, OCR text, chats or email addresses for this.","Decline","Accept","All","No letters in this folder.","Letter from archive","Selected letter from the local archive:","Explain this letter again","Explain this letter again in detail and in simple language. What exactly is required from me and what should I do next?","Family profiles","Active profile: {name}","Personal","Encrypted archive backup","Export and restore only with your password","Local data was deleted, but account deletion could not be completed.","New family profile","Profile name","PIN (optional)","We recommend a PIN on a shared device.","Create","Open","The PIN is incorrect.","Add profile","Each profile has a separate local archive. Originals, OCR and replies are not uploaded to the cloud.","Active profile","Separate local archive","The password must contain at least 10 characters.","The encrypted backup is ready to save.","The backup could not be created.","Enter the backup password.","{count} letters restored locally.","The backup could not be restored.","Encrypted backup","The backup is encrypted with AES-256-GCM and your password. We do not store the password and cannot recover it.","Backup password","At least 10 characters","Create encrypted backup","Restore backup to this profile","Organize","Open deadlines and bills stay locally on this device.","Overdue","Today","This week","Later","No items.","Organize letter","Folder","Communication status","Tags","e.g. urgent, appeal, children","Separate tags with commas.","The bill is paid","Amount not recognized","Save locally","No deadline","Pay by","Deadline","Reply prepared","Sent","Awaiting reply","Inbox","Housing","Work","Family","Insurance","Taxes","Finance","High priority","Medium priority","Low priority","This saved analysis was created in another language. Open the Assistant and explain the letter again to receive it in the currently selected language.","BriefAI uses account, language, subscription and optional notification data. Documents, OCR text, analyses, replies and letter chats remain in local device storage.","Firebase provides authentication and entitlement metadata. With consent, only the OCR text needed for the current request is sent securely to OpenAI and is not added to a cloud archive. Payments are handled by authorized store or payment providers.","Local data remains until you delete it or the app data. You can export or permanently delete your local archive and account from the app. Use the contact details below for additional requests.","BriefAI helps explain German letters in plain language. AI can make mistakes and does not replace legal, tax, medical or financial advice. Always verify deadlines, amounts and the original letter.","New accounts receive introductory analyses. Paid plans renew automatically until cancelled in the app-store account settings. Deleting the app does not cancel a subscription.","Do not use the app for unlawful activity, unauthorized documents, bypassing limits or attacks on the service. Terms may be updated for legal, security or functional reasons."],t.w)
B.bbI=new A.V(B.cD,["Die Online-KI ist derzeit nicht verf\xfcgbar. OCR und lokale Analyse funktionieren auf diesem Ger\xe4t weiterhin.","Fristenkalender","Keine offenen Fristen.","{today} heute \xb7 {week} diese Woche \xb7 {overdue} \xfcberf\xe4llig","Datenschutzauswahl","D\xfcrfen wir anonyme Besuche und Installationsklicks messen? Briefe, OCR-Texte, Chats oder E-Mail-Adressen werden daf\xfcr nie gespeichert.","Ablehnen","Akzeptieren","Alle","Keine Briefe in diesem Ordner.","Brief aus dem Archiv","Ausgew\xe4hlter Brief aus dem lokalen Archiv:","Diesen Brief erneut erkl\xe4ren","Erkl\xe4re mir diesen Brief noch einmal ausf\xfchrlich und einfach. Was wird genau von mir verlangt und was ist mein n\xe4chster Schritt?","Familienprofile","Aktives Profil: {name}","Pers\xf6nlich","Verschl\xfcsseltes Archiv-Backup","Export und Wiederherstellung nur mit Ihrem Passwort","Lokale Daten wurden gel\xf6scht, das Konto konnte jedoch nicht vollst\xe4ndig gel\xf6scht werden.","Neues Familienprofil","Profilname","PIN (optional)","Auf einem gemeinsam genutzten Ger\xe4t empfehlen wir eine PIN.","Erstellen","\xd6ffnen","Die PIN ist falsch.","Profil hinzuf\xfcgen","Jedes Profil hat ein getrenntes lokales Archiv. Originale, OCR und Antworten werden nicht in die Cloud hochgeladen.","Aktives Profil","Getrenntes lokales Archiv","Das Passwort muss mindestens 10 Zeichen enthalten.","Das verschl\xfcsselte Backup kann gespeichert werden.","Das Backup konnte nicht erstellt werden.","Geben Sie das Backup-Passwort ein.","{count} Briefe wurden lokal wiederhergestellt.","Das Backup konnte nicht wiederhergestellt werden.","Verschl\xfcsseltes Backup","Das Backup wird mit AES-256-GCM und Ihrem Passwort verschl\xfcsselt. Wir speichern das Passwort nicht und k\xf6nnen es nicht wiederherstellen.","Backup-Passwort","Mindestens 10 Zeichen","Verschl\xfcsseltes Backup erstellen","Backup in diesem Profil wiederherstellen","Organisieren","Offene Fristen und Rechnungen bleiben lokal auf diesem Ger\xe4t.","\xdcberf\xe4llig","Heute","Diese Woche","Sp\xe4ter","Keine Eintr\xe4ge.","Brief organisieren","Ordner","Kommunikationsstatus","Schlagw\xf6rter","z. B. dringend, Widerspruch, Kinder","Schlagw\xf6rter durch Kommas trennen.","Die Rechnung ist bezahlt","Betrag nicht erkannt","Lokal speichern","Keine Frist","Zahlbar bis","Frist","Antwort vorbereitet","Gesendet","Warten auf Antwort","Eingang","Wohnen","Arbeit","Familie","Versicherung","Steuern","Finanzen","Hohe Priorit\xe4t","Mittlere Priorit\xe4t","Niedrige Priorit\xe4t","Diese gespeicherte Analyse wurde in einer anderen Sprache erstellt. \xd6ffnen Sie den Assistenten und lassen Sie den Brief erneut erkl\xe4ren, um ihn in der aktuell gew\xe4hlten Sprache zu erhalten.","BriefAI verwendet Konto-, Sprach-, Abo- und optionale Benachrichtigungsdaten. Dokumente, OCR-Text, Analysen, Antworten und Brief-Chats bleiben im lokalen Ger\xe4tespeicher.","Firebase stellt Authentifizierung und Berechtigungsmetadaten bereit. Mit Einwilligung wird nur der f\xfcr die aktuelle Anfrage ben\xf6tigte OCR-Text sicher an OpenAI gesendet und nicht in ein Cloud-Archiv aufgenommen. Zahlungen verarbeiten autorisierte Store- oder Zahlungsanbieter.","Lokale Daten bleiben gespeichert, bis Sie sie oder die App-Daten l\xf6schen. In der App k\xf6nnen Sie Ihr lokales Archiv und Konto exportieren oder dauerhaft l\xf6schen. Weitere Anfragen richten Sie an die unten angegebenen Kontaktdaten.","BriefAI erkl\xe4rt deutsche Schreiben in verst\xe4ndlicher Sprache. KI kann Fehler machen und ersetzt keine Rechts-, Steuer-, medizinische oder Finanzberatung. Pr\xfcfen Sie stets Fristen, Betr\xe4ge und das Original.","Neue Konten erhalten Einf\xfchrungsanalysen. Bezahlte Tarife verl\xe4ngern sich automatisch, bis sie in den Kontoeinstellungen des App-Stores gek\xfcndigt werden. Das L\xf6schen der App beendet kein Abo.","Nutzen Sie die App nicht f\xfcr rechtswidrige Handlungen, unbefugte Dokumente, das Umgehen von Limits oder Angriffe auf den Dienst. Bedingungen k\xf6nnen aus rechtlichen, sicherheitsbezogenen oder funktionalen Gr\xfcnden aktualisiert werden."],t.w)
B.bbz=new A.V(B.cD,[u._,"Kalendar rokova","Nema otvorenih rokova.","{today} danas \xb7 {week} ove nedelje \xb7 {overdue} kasni","Izbor privatnosti","Da li dozvoljavate anonimno merenje poseta i klikova za instalaciju? Pisma, OCR tekst, razgovore i email adrese nikada ne \u010duvamo u tu svrhu.","Odbij","Prihvatam","Sve","Nema pisama u ovom folderu.","Pismo iz arhive","Izabrano pismo iz lokalne arhive:","Objasni ovo pismo ponovo","Objasni mi ovo pismo ponovo detaljno i jednostavnim jezikom. \u0160ta se ta\u010dno tra\u017ei od mene i koji je slede\u0107i korak?","Porodi\u010dni profili","Aktivan profil: {name}","Li\u010dni","\u0160ifrovani backup arhive","Izvoz i vra\u0107anje samo uz va\u0161u lozinku","Lokalni podaci su obrisani, ali brisanje naloga nije zavr\u0161eno.","Novi porodi\u010dni profil","Ime profila","PIN (opciono)","Za zajedni\u010dki ure\u0111aj preporu\u010dujemo PIN.","Kreiraj","Otvori","PIN nije ispravan.","Dodaj profil","Svaki profil ima odvojenu lokalnu arhivu. Originali, OCR i odgovori ne odlaze u cloud.","Aktivan profil","Odvojena lokalna arhiva","Lozinka mora imati najmanje 10 znakova.","\u0160ifrovani backup je spreman za \u010duvanje.","Backup nije uspeo.","Unesite lozinku backupa.","Lokalno je vra\u0107eno {count} pisama.","Vra\u0107anje nije uspelo.","\u0160ifrovani backup","Backup je AES-256-GCM \u0161ifrovan va\u0161om lozinkom. Lozinku ne \u010duvamo i ne mo\u017eemo je vratiti.","Lozinka za backup","Najmanje 10 znakova","Napravi \u0161ifrovani backup","Vrati backup na ovaj profil","Organizuj",u.E,"Kasni","Danas","Ove nedelje","Kasnije","Nema stavki.","Organizuj pismo","Folder","Status komunikacije","Oznake","npr. hitno, \u017ealba, deca","Odvojite oznake zarezom.","Ra\u010dun je pla\u0107en","Iznos nije prepoznat","Sa\u010duvaj lokalno","Bez roka","Pla\u0107anje do","Rok","Odgovor pripremljen","Poslato","\u010ceka se odgovor","Prijemno","Stanovanje","Posao","Porodica","Osiguranje","Porezi","Finansije","Visok prioritet","Srednji prioritet","Nizak prioritet",u.f,"BriefAI koristi podatke o nalogu, jeziku, pretplati i opcionim obave\u0161tenjima. Dokumenti, OCR tekst, analize, odgovori i razgovori o pismu ostaju u lokalnom skladi\u0161tu ure\u0111aja.","Firebase obezbe\u0111uje autentifikaciju i podatke o pravima kori\u0161\u0107enja. Uz saglasnost se samo OCR tekst potreban za trenutni zahtev bezbedno \u0161alje OpenAI-ju i ne dodaje u cloud arhivu. Pla\u0107anja obra\u0111uju ovla\u0161\u0107ene prodavnice ili pru\u017eaoci pla\u0107anja.","Lokalni podaci ostaju dok ih ne obri\u0161ete ili ne izbri\u0161ete podatke aplikacije. U aplikaciji mo\u017eete izvesti ili trajno obrisati lokalnu arhivu i nalog. Za dodatne zahteve koristite kontakt ispod.","BriefAI poma\u017ee da razumete nema\u010dka pisma jednostavnim jezikom. AI mo\u017ee pogre\u0161iti i ne zamenjuje pravni, poreski, medicinski ili finansijski savet. Uvek proverite rokove, iznose i originalno pismo.","Novi nalozi dobijaju uvodne analize. Pla\u0107eni paketi se automatski obnavljaju dok ih ne otka\u017eete u pode\u0161avanjima naloga prodavnice aplikacija. Brisanje aplikacije ne otkazuje pretplatu.","Ne koristite aplikaciju za nezakonite radnje, neovla\u0161\u0107ene dokumente, zaobila\u017eenje ograni\u010denja ili napade na uslugu. Uslovi se mogu a\u017eurirati zbog zakona, bezbednosti ili funkcionalnosti."],t.w)
B.bbK=new A.V(B.cD,["Mre\u017eni AI trenuta\u010dno nije dostupan. OCR i lokalna analiza i dalje rade na ovom ure\u0111aju.","Kalendar rokova","Nema otvorenih rokova.","{today} danas \xb7 {week} ovaj tjedan \xb7 {overdue} kasni","Odabir privatnosti","Dopu\u0161tate li anonimno mjerenje posjeta i klikova za instalaciju? Pisma, OCR tekst, razgovore i adrese e-po\u0161te nikada ne spremamo u tu svrhu.","Odbij","Prihvati","Sve","Nema pisama u ovoj mapi.","Pismo iz arhive","Odabrano pismo iz lokalne arhive:","Ponovno objasni ovo pismo","Objasni mi ovo pismo ponovno detaljno i jednostavnim jezikom. \u0160to se to\u010dno tra\u017ei od mene i koji je sljede\u0107i korak?","Obiteljski profili","Aktivan profil: {name}","Osobni","\u0160ifrirana sigurnosna kopija arhive","Izvoz i vra\u0107anje samo uz va\u0161u lozinku","Lokalni podaci su izbrisani, ali brisanje ra\u010duna nije dovr\u0161eno.","Novi obiteljski profil","Naziv profila","PIN (neobavezno)","Za zajedni\u010dki ure\u0111aj preporu\u010dujemo PIN.","Izradi","Otvori","PIN nije ispravan.","Dodaj profil","Svaki profil ima odvojenu lokalnu arhivu. Izvornici, OCR i odgovori ne prenose se u oblak.","Aktivan profil","Odvojena lokalna arhiva","Lozinka mora imati najmanje 10 znakova.","\u0160ifrirana sigurnosna kopija spremna je za spremanje.","Sigurnosnu kopiju nije bilo mogu\u0107e izraditi.","Unesite lozinku sigurnosne kopije.","Lokalno je vra\u0107eno {count} pisama.","Vra\u0107anje sigurnosne kopije nije uspjelo.","\u0160ifrirana sigurnosna kopija","Sigurnosna kopija \u0161ifrirana je AES-256-GCM-om i va\u0161om lozinkom. Lozinku ne spremamo i ne mo\u017eemo je vratiti.","Lozinka sigurnosne kopije","Najmanje 10 znakova","Izradi \u0161ifriranu sigurnosnu kopiju","Vrati sigurnosnu kopiju na ovaj profil","Organiziraj",u.E,"Kasni","Danas","Ovaj tjedan","Kasnije","Nema stavki.","Organiziraj pismo","Mapa","Status komunikacije","Oznake","npr. hitno, \u017ealba, djeca","Odvojite oznake zarezima.","Ra\u010dun je pla\u0107en","Iznos nije prepoznat","Spremi lokalno","Bez roka","Platiti do","Rok","Odgovor pripremljen","Poslano","\u010ceka se odgovor","Ulazno","Stanovanje","Posao","Obitelj","Osiguranje","Porezi","Financije","Visok prioritet","Srednji prioritet","Nizak prioritet","Ova spremljena analiza izra\u0111ena je na drugom jeziku. Otvorite Asistenta i ponovno objasnite pismo kako biste ga dobili na trenuta\u010dno odabranom jeziku.","BriefAI koristi podatke o ra\u010dunu, jeziku, pretplati i neobaveznim obavijestima. Dokumenti, OCR tekst, analize, odgovori i razgovori o pismu ostaju u lokalnoj pohrani ure\u0111aja.","Firebase omogu\u0107uje prijavu i podatke o pravima kori\u0161tenja. Uz privolu se samo OCR tekst potreban za trenuta\u010dni zahtjev sigurno \u0161alje OpenAI-ju i ne dodaje u arhivu u oblaku. Pla\u0107anja obra\u0111uju ovla\u0161tene trgovine ili pru\u017eatelji pla\u0107anja.","Lokalni podaci ostaju dok ih ne izbri\u0161ete ili ne uklonite podatke aplikacije. U aplikaciji mo\u017eete izvesti ili trajno izbrisati lokalnu arhivu i ra\u010dun. Za dodatne zahtjeve koristite kontakt u nastavku.","BriefAI poma\u017ee objasniti njema\u010dka pisma jednostavnim jezikom. AI mo\u017ee pogrije\u0161iti i ne zamjenjuje pravni, porezni, medicinski ili financijski savjet. Uvijek provjerite rokove, iznose i izvorno pismo.","Novi ra\u010duni dobivaju uvodne analize. Pla\u0107eni paketi automatski se obnavljaju dok ih ne otka\u017eete u postavkama ra\u010duna trgovine aplikacija. Brisanje aplikacije ne otkazuje pretplatu.","Ne koristite aplikaciju za nezakonite radnje, neovla\u0161tene dokumente, zaobila\u017eenje ograni\u010denja ili napade na uslugu. Uvjeti se mogu a\u017eurirati zbog zakona, sigurnosti ili funkcionalnosti."],t.w)
